WEBVTT

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:13.990
The hero's party presses on to save their
princess, finally finding their way again.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.990
Ancient Volcano

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:20.410
They were slowly but surely making
their way to the Demon Castle.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.490
We've been making smooth progress
after getting back onto the right path.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.740
Let's keep at it--Hm?

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.950
What are you doing, Kisho?

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:32.200
It's about time I try out this spell.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.620
Is this--?

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:43.870
The princess' gem is emitting a greater
amount of peaceful aura than expected!

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:47.200
We may be able to create a wormhole
to the Demon Castle!

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.080
Can you?

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.370
Oh, dear, she's sleeping so peacefully.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.120
Gem

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.950
Hey, don't wake her!

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.700
I wonder what she's dreaming about?

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:03.330
Hm?

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:07.410
Now, Dawner!

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.910
Huh?

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:12.740
What is it, Dawner?

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:15.830
My finger's hitting something.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:19.700
Careful. We have no idea
what's on the other end.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:20.700
Okay.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.870
I think it just moved!

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.620
Oh, no! The spell is becoming unstable!

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:28.950
Pull your hand back!

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:35.790
Oh, dear. I must report this.

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:41.540
It's no good.
The peaceful aura is completely gone.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:44.040
The distance may still be too great.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:52.200
I see. But we can use this spell to get
into the castle once we get closer.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:56.450
Yeah. And to do that,
we must defeat the demon top ten.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.540
That's right.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.240
I'll be there soon!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:04.450
I, Dawner the Hero, swear to save you, Princess!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:40.990
"Eighth Night"
"The Princess and the Frightful Demon Nightmare"

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.330
You know why I've summoned you all here?

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.990
Because we just had some magical
interference from the hero, right?

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:56.240
Yes! And the heroes are headed
to the Ancient Volcano

00:03:53.750 --> 00:04:00.920
Defeat Dawner the Hero!

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.660
to defeat the next top ten demon!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.290
Time to fire ourselves up again!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:05.120
And consequently,
with the Ancient Volcano's boss present,

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.620
we will now hold a send-off party for him!

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.450
Yeah!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.540
I'm counting on you!

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.540
Yeah!

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.950
Princess, what are you doing--

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:27.040
I just had a nightmare.
Let me tell you about it.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.830
Cause

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:30.080
Why the heck is she here?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:35.540
H-Hey, we're about to have a send-off party
before going out to fight the hero--

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:40.080
They say you feel better after telling
someone about your nightmare.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.370
Ignored.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:45.580
Listen, you!
This battle will eventually affect you, too.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.660
So in my dream...

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.410
She'll stop at nothing.

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:52.040
Okay, fine. But keep it short.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.580
Demon King!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.290
My dream was about a childhood memory.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:00.290
And a boy, my childhood friend, was in it.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.160
His name was...

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.870
...D-Whatsit.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.040
D-Whatsit?!

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.790
Not a memorable kid, huh?

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.120
Couldn't have been.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.410
D-Whatsit was so mean.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.830
Princess!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.490
Hm?

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.830
Princess! These are for you!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.700
He stabbed me with rose thorns.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:27.540
D-Whatsit?!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.490
And there was a bee in the flower bouquet.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.330
D-Whatsit...

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.580
Princess! Watch out!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.830
Then he gobbled the bee up.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:35.680
Panicking

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:35.730
Panicking

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:35.770
Panicking

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:35.810
Panicking

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:35.850
Panicking

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:35.890
Panicking

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:40.400
Panicking

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.660
This D-Whatsit is one scary kid!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:41.740
And plus...

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.450
It was sweet!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:49.160
Panicking

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.540
...he told me what it tasted like.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.370
D-Whatsit?!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.200
How frightening. What a crazy kid!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.950
How could you forget his name?!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:58.080
U-Uh, okay, well...

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:01.700
Uh, right! Let's start Fire Venom
Dragon's send-off party.

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:02.790
Right.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:07.540
Then it was the time when D-Whatsit
dragged me to a picnic.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:10.120
The nightmare continues!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:13.740
First, though we had attendants,
we got separated from them

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.990
because of his horrid sense of direction.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.370
In a pinch, right off the bat!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.490
And then...

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:21.540
Princess, let's race to the top!

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.700
Race in that situation?!

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:28.620
D-Whatsit was a fast runner.
I lost sight of him immediately.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:36.540
The road was frightening. I came across
a person's legs sticking out from the ground

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.790
and a boy who'd fallen into a trap.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:43.200
That was D-Whatsit, Princess!

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:48.240
Then when I didn't see anyone at the top,
I just turned back.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.450
Princess?!

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:53.620
I didn't feel a need to tell
anyone about D-Whatsit.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.140
Hey!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.620
After half a year...

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.370
That means D-Whatsit died, Princess!

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:00.910
Wh-Why didn't you tell anyone?

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:04.660
He wasn't very memorable, so I forgot.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.620
D-Whatsit!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.830
But then, D-Whatsit returned.

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:10.910
What?!

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.120
Princess!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.790
I'm glad you are well.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:19.200
And we had our first conversation in a while.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:20.000
Who are you?

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.700
At least remember him!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.040
He was just so forgettable.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.450
I'm so glad!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.040
Who is he?

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:33.760
Reported

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.910
Wait, that wasn't a conversation.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:34.080
Conversations require some
back and forth, Princess!

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.950
I feel so sorry for D-Whatsit!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:40.540
Though D-Whatsit's a real piece of work himself.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:44.410
I bet D-Whatsit's still doing idiotic stuff now.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:49.700
But Princess, that was more of a nightmare
for D-Whatsit than for you.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.410
Looking back, it's a nice memory--

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:56.200
But the worst part of the nightmare

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:02.490
was when my father told me
that D-Whatsit was my fiance.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.580
That was my whole dream.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.160
What?!

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:17.700
--A dream?! Was that part true?!
--Was that reality or dream?!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:19.490
Oh, she left!

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:25.330
But really, why did I suddenly
dream about my past?

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:29.660
I wonder what D-Whatsit is like now.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:36.660
Oh, well, I got to share my whole dream,
so I feel better now.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:41.160
I probably won't see D-Whatsit
ever again anyway.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.290
Princess!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.910
Zzz...

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.740
The princess' fiance and childhood friend

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:53.370
who has no sense of direction
and whose name starts with "D."

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:03.290
Fire Venom Dragon.
Make sure you annihilate the hero.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:05.790
H-Huh? O-Okay.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.120
Achoo!

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.540
Oh! Someone's talking about me!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.740
Gross.

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:15.990
D-Whatsit

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.870
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> !

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:19.740
Ancient Volcano

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:19.740
The hero's party reached the Ancient Volcano

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:24.830
to defeat the next big ten demon.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:25.990
Stay alert.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:31.620
Took you long enough, Hero!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:33.040
You're--

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:36.660
One of the big ten, Fire Venom Dragon!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.370
I'm itching to fight!

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.950
You'll never defeat us!

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:48.240
A battle to the death was about to begin.

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:50.580
Meanwhile...

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.240
To my Dear Mother,

00:09:53.240 --> 00:10:00.200
Your daughter Sya <i>was</i> doing
surprisingly well at the Demon Castle.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:06.240
However, a dreadful disease now eats away at me.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:10.370
I cannot sleep from the pain it afflicts.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:11.540
What's more...

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:18.450
an even greater obstacle
prevents treatment of my illness.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:13.740
Princess!

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:14.740
Hey, Princess!

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:16.540
It's okay! You'll be fine!

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.450
They'll take a look at you now.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.330
Come on, get up!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.450
N-No! Let go!

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:28.410
The demons eat away at my youthful body.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:31.660
If only I had not indulged
in the sweet pleasures of life.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.330
Sya.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:37.040
Don't recite a death poem for one measly cavity!

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.450
We've got a dentist here
at the Demon Castle! Okay?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.620
Demon Castle Clinic

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.370
Cursed Dentist

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:44.160
Come now, Princess. Open your mouth.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.330
You're a stranger.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:53.450
I'm the Cursed Dentist. With my dexterity
and many talents, I'm also a musician.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.370
All right. Move your hand away.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.990
Now open your mouth.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.160
You call that open?!

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:03.910
The pain won't stop unless
you show me your affected tooth.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.990
Can't I just drink a potion?

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:11.700
Cavities are caused by tiny fairies,
so it won't get better unless they're removed.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.990
See now? Okay, open up.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.450
Why are you blushing?

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:22.910
No matter. Now that you've opened a bit,
place some pressure on the jaw and...

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.290
Hey, you okay?!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.240
Escaped

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.790
O-Oh, no! Go after her...

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.290
It hurts!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.290
Of course it does!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.370
All right. I recruited some help.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.760
Healer

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.760
Healer

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.760
Doctor

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.760
Doctor

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.870
Let's start the procedure...

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.700
P-Princess, it'll be okay.
You'll get anesthesia.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:48.870
That's not... what... I'm worried about.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.200
I'll be defiled.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.660
What in the world do you think a dentist is?!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.520
Doc Anteater

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.790
Don't you want to get better? You need to open your mouth.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:59.990
What wrong? You don't want people
looking into your mouth or something?

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.410
That looks like the problem.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:02.830
But why?!

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:03.950
Don't look inside.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.580
But your cavity--

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.120
Treat it without looking inside!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.080
She's asking for the impossible!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.200
But...

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.910
Cursed Doctor!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:16.580
None of the sources specify a female human
custom of being shy about their mouths.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.450
We can't figure out the reason.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.910
Could she be hiding a more serious illness?

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:22.950
What?!

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:24.870
Is it life-threatening?!

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:28.370
It's possible with her behavior.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.990
And so the rumors...

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:33.330
Hey, you hear that the princess
is terminally sick?

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.790
Oh, dear!

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.290
Huh? Sick in the head?

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.790
Wanna be blown to bits?!

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:42.910
What?! Her head blew up and she's about to die?

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.620
...spread through the Demon Castle like fire.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.200
--She's done for.
--What to do?
--No way!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.990
I heard it's a big operation.

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.450
Stay strong, Princess!

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:57.660
Don't die!

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:58.830
She's died a lot already, though.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:00.790
She has died a lot. No! That's not the point!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:04.720
Cubey

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.910
What? Are they all here to cheer on the human princess?

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:04.950
Princess!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:07.410
Wow! She's so popular!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:08.620
Nobody there
to retort

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:12.620
Princess, everyone's here to cheer you on.
Open your mouth!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.410
Do as you're told now, Princess.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.040
Come now, let us see inside your mouth.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:22.790
Come on, you can do it.
Say "ah." "Ah." Go "ah" for us.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:26.870
I'm okay if it's a Teddy Demon looking.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:27.870
What?

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:35.990
I will now begin the procedure
for Princess Syalis' cavity.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:42.080
What the heck?!

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:45.370
There's something seriously wrong here!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.220
Don't look~!!

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.790
Sorry! Okay, okay!

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:53.700
Fine! Teddy Demon!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.200
How does it look?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:04.480
Bigger than my mouth!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.950
That's it! I'm calling it quits!

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:12.870
Afterwards... after eight long hours
for one cavity,

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:15.450
they finished treatment.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:21.450
Thanks.

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:27.950
Whatever. What did you want
to hide so badly anyway?

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:29.240
It's a secret.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.990
What?

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:37.200
They finished fixing my cavity,
and I don't think they noticed my secret.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:43.490
Yes, my biggest complex about
my body is inside my mouth.

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:47.330
My tongue is slightly shorter than average.

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:48.790
Trivial

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:52.370
I'm feeling sleepy from relief...

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.660
Zzz...

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:02.660
Huh? Wait...

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:06.620
We should've just treated her
while she was asleep!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.870
You're right!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:15.930
Cursed Dentist

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.790
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:26.700
It was a long and bitter fight.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:34.870
The fierce battle to the death between
the hero and Fire Venom Dragon

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.450
lasted for three days and three nights.

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:41.450
Man, he got thrashed.

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:42.580
Welcome back.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:46.290
My sympathies, as your powers
are sealed now, too...

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:52.080
You get revived if the hero defeats you,
but your powers stay sealed.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:54.700
I thought you'd put up a better fight.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:57.790
We even gave you various items to assist you.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:58.470
That's what did it.

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.870
What?

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:03.790
I was defeated because those
items got switched out for others.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:05.620
I-It can't be!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:06.540
Who's the culprit?!

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.080
Do you have any clues?

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:11.700
The first odd thing I noticed
was that the item bag

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.660
was made of Ghost Shroud cloth.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.040
Oh, it was the princess.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.370
It was the princess.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:19.700
There's no doubt.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:22.870
So it <i>was</i> her. I couldn't believe it.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.830
Th-Then, she emptied all the potion flasks?

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:27.700
Seriously?

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:31.410
High potions are basically sports drinks to her.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:37.120
What? Th-Then, she swapped
all the grenades to avocados, too?

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.540
Avocados?!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.450
What? Wasn't it the princess?

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:43.080
Avocados are supposed to help you sleep, though.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.540
Why would the princess share them?

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.370
I-I remember now...

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.900
Day Before Battle

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:59.660
For battle with hero

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:57.160
It's dangerous to leave battle items lying around like this.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:17:00.870
The princess might tinker with them.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.950
I'll put these Forest Area-grown
avocados in as dummies for now,

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.160
then switch the grenades back in later.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.590
Forgot to switch back

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.660
Now I've done it!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:16.950
I-It must have been the princess!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:22.270
False accusation

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:18.540
Curse that princess!

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.160
You're looking a little pale there.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.490
Th-This is how I usually look.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.080
Th-Then how about that?

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.790
Not bad, Hero.

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:32.490
But I have a secret grimoire
here from the Demon King--

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:34.660
How to Get Proper Sleep ♡ With Pictures

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.870
Likely the princess, too.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:38.990
But why?

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.410
I-I remember now...

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.660
No, Princess!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:50.830
As a captive, you shouldn't be reading
for pleasure. I'm confiscating this!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.830
Give it back!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.410
Stop hitting me!

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.620
Hm?

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:57.700
Why is this ordinary battered
book with the battle items?

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.370
Fine, I'll give this battered book
to you in exchange.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:04.490
Yay, a difficult book. Okay, then.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:09.400
Cannot differentiate between
a grimoire and normal book

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.240
I-It was the princess.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:13.620
It was her. It must've been!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:19.530
False accusation

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.410
Curse that princess!

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:17.950
Your eyes are looking shifty there.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.700
Th-They're not!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.910
Then, that must've been the princess, too!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.080
There's more?

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.370
Not yet. I'm not going down yet!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:34.080
Take this attack from the Demon King's
special princess-model weapon!

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:34.090
This

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:34.130
This

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:34.170
This

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:34.210
This

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:34.250
This

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:34.300
This

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.670
This

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:39.490
It should be positioned here
at this volcano already.

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.660
Activate!

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.620
Wh-What's happening?!

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:51.290
I'm sleepy! I'm sleeping now.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:54.660
What's going on? The giant princess-model weapon

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:57.410
has been replaced by this
mysterious midget robot!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.490
I can't believe it!

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:00.080
Would the princess go that far?

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.080
O-Oh, yeah...

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:08.330
We didn't get a chance to use it last time,

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:13.120
but it's finally our chance to send
out the princess-model weapon!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:15.410
It's as diabolical as the princess.

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:18.490
Is that supposed to be <i>me</i> ?

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:22.330
It doesn't look like me.
It doesn't look like me!

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.540
O-Okay, I'll modify it.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:27.700
What part's most unlike you?

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:28.870
Its size.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:29.990
That's your main compliant?

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:32.450
And this... and this.

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:32.450
Ah, okay.

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.990
And this... and this... and that.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.440
Forgot midway that it's
supposed to be a weapon

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:39.660
I admit that I modified too much.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:45.450
Man, not bad for a princess.
She's one frightening princess.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:50.910
Another
false accusation

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.870
She really is!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.790
Demon King, why're you sweating profusely?

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:54.910
Curse that princess!
Just how much did she interfere?

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:57.410
Then that must have been the princess, too!

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:58.700
You still have more?

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:02.330
There was this huge bomb in the item bag.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.830
It's not over! Take my final move--

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.790
It exploded suddenly.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:11.950
What?!

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:13.830
That's mostly what did me in.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:16.740
Th-That reminds me...

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:20.700
The hero is likely the princess' fiance.

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:24.580
Can he defeat Fire Venom Dragon? I'm not sure.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:28.830
But I guess I can just blow
Fire Venom Dragon to bits.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.410
In goes this rather nasty bomb.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.790
Inadvertently gave in
to the devil's temptation

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:39.080
Oh, well, you could say that was the princess!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:44.720
Repeated
false accusations

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.410
I knew it! It was the princess.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:43.330
Got a glazed look in your eyes there.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:44.990
What do you mean?

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:48.740
So it was all the princess' doing?

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.790
Y-Yeah.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.200
Must've been tough.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:59.660
Unforgivable! The princess is probably
mocking us at this very moment!

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:02.290
Y-You really think so?

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:05.040
She's not just trying to lead
the hero to victory,

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:07.410
she's trying to destroy all demonkind!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:11.290
I-I'm not sure about that...

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.910
Achoo.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.700
Someone's talking about me.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:17.040
What? You know something I don't?

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:19.910
N-No!

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:21.450
Not at all!

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:22.740
Oh, no!

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:28.200
The princess is such a rascal!

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.620
Zzz...

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:36.160
Why are you blocking me?!

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:37.910
I must give that princess a telling off!

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:39.450
Come on, now!

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:42.620
It's the princess' fault, but it's not
really her fault, you know?!

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:45.200
We must accept the consequences of our loss!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.490
--What?
--Yes, ours!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:49.660
--I agree with what Alraune just said!
--What?!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.620
Oh, dear?

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:57.990
While the wretched liars fought...

00:21:57.990 --> 00:22:01.370
Victory! All right, onward we go!

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.120
...Dawner the Hero made a step forward.

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:10.240
No reaction. This spell is useless.

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:44.950
"In spring one sleeps
a sleep that knows no dawn."

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:46.990
It means that on comfortable spring nights,

00:23:46.990 --> 00:23:50.330
you don't notice when dawn breaks,
causing you to oversleep.

00:23:50.330 --> 00:23:52.450
Please remember me, Dawner the Hero!

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.830
Next time,
"The Princess and Hostage Training Week."

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:56.120
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> !
